    "intro": "O Vale Sagrado dos Incas é um dos destinos mais visitados perto de Cusco. Este vale combina paisagens […]",
    "content_html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/acSqEEXkSo7D3WWkn50g5Ao58OL4s3jdUzZcMDaIn10- YiR1ELZCT_BoqqKVg5XKvRrTpqR6OtvPE68sq4lO9SdlVnehkF2gf-ugzIFCJPg?propósito=tamanho completo&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/cHt2c7gHEuwEx1ciTe_e3Wz_NFutB_aIu-I2Q1-JRj8k0zNN8aDUYV8QROiCYb7i25lqkLi6v-48GAd-RvIAzXPlGipfTTr9McQJF-FP6O4?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/C6v_jwsRqgcxg9E_R0fPmfgQfSyX8sIEaXrLZzZUl3uY CoYxpf-lzb1rCLsVal_r6tiwNzgLc6UAplcJzK4FA49ZTbarIfF9Hm83XElSUOY?propósito=tamanho completo&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/AQ7zbBryHQoLzUsMS8NfKZ8_rJr5hWH2IzsAIa_5zY8LBkD5HnoHijgOQ1dT3Vetvr9KBypSYyrLuNHhYscKgtqF9tpY_tZhFfd4C1IqE5s?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/8Ya_2C_l6sSc7BvTRFd5jOMK3bP_RihNI4BzHeZPUSiU uLmf5OG5Vd4Y5ljyLOd21NgoOYp9yYRoD_7YTSAX9PXyLeZvbbcHjO5TNvBOK9s?propósito=tamanho completo&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/Ef4-_VaaJwKA_Qw7THrkIfnBE0x3RGjnlP4bXWllno-qc8p9uheZSbVLd9jWlPu7LqSiyeONSPpgWJZOU6AQEeWigYJ_sGtXbIdNJy-db7I?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Vale Sagrado dos Incas</a></strong> É um dos destinos mais visitados perto <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Cuzco</a></strong>. Este vale combina paisagens andinas, sítios arqueológicos e cidades tradicionais cheias de história. Além disso, é uma parada ideal antes de visitar <strong>Machu Picchu</strong>.</p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"pueblos-imperdibles\">Cidades imperdíveis</h3>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Pisac</a></strong></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/9qdTXfO0wnM9i0yubABXnGjrPuYm-OWj9wziujxNPChbGBYdRkvXFBiKLpb7qCDBdrQhOhQol_TOlyoU6EGRQrip4Qmq5OlvV60miCg0NOs?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/c2Itl6P9uPqFZl_Vdn3fbxh5tu5BsrnTReb3fF_xfuSTD10uf74P_--nimgCvUAp_eNEelT-vV5YkWDEL0lFqBD2dANT54kxbEv0DWgsk9c?purpose=inline\"/></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/q7TPZBzx_kH_i_v2F_y3xatzkSxM5YiRrp77xi5R9-O_yjcI0EClHvyCOfazjCcZWagPACOeBZNpqO_lvtCIceFfuEjYjos95xopdQwOJZ0?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/bieF542YWB4fdx9TCyBnoUXhSHic2gj1VfMhPL_yODsJxxxfaChsV3eiNRx4rtYHW-87t2UL1302mbSn_-eFHjJ4byysUULwoIvOvPm3iMg?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://kenkoadventures.com/f_ls/2024-11/Pisac%20Market%20A%20Vibrant%20Showcase%20of%20Andean%20Culture.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://kenkoadventures.com/f_ls/2024-11/Pisac%20Market%20A%20Vibrant%20Showcase%20of%20Andean%20Culture.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Famosa pelo seu complexo arqueológico e pelo seu mercado de artesanato. Dos terraços incas você tem vistas incríveis do vale.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Ollantaytambo</a></strong></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/5B6cAwYJT1-rVPcQQUIjA3Hejj2hSx8H1KOeJt4FqfME LZQFjO9VHxg766UguTLzpAWkowK-2A0NcK6x3yXteHtnzHpA3tKJtKISvIO6W_o?propósito=tamanho completo&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/6zf5N0FbeRyaPl8-vDwlmkHP6HhNKqxvEcf7llltIgvPearWddkA7mwvSgkx3LBtFWnnRdKnxGc1Rw8XqmR6DwmnPzJezrvgIW7SA_3s2PA?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/p1nygHhO5gAuHU2-ozBTpTBQsUEv8hX9FabeRHLJQLc_neE-QLA5NMcDdJDPMZzjjC9oOsEHmRlxm6etMMU50Lq5_lqldxgBha8ikpc-N5s?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/dUHH0ifaBbg7K5HoEM5qM2ahb068pSriduPSM1i7TwJxC8ItkBFopIwT6AxMQFato3LFYUwSigtkYw5m1mpeIlerncoHmEXPd981K1DBQD8?purpose=inline\"/></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/B2DxiQ9fXTDOyrRIWgvARmrklglUylji4bTWzx1zusfIDC2pxpnHiyJ8zuxL6DgHdNlGKWclUP4XLFDi3_IOqxk5XzM_QzwCcma0u2sls_o?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/QM6n-b_4Bg4J8lzhEqJbSNCP4pUaq7TXZ7CLrqM3gLL5VMD4vd2ZW5t-QbABjGzJfJ-bZ8xZCtoXri_YLVy7P6v96fQ_lWyz7hFLQv9iw4w?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Uma das cidades incas mais bem preservadas. Suas ruas de pedra e sua fortaleza arqueológica fazem dele um lugar histórico único.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Chinchero</a></strong></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/WmRtMnMaWjy5WFXT_oQhYOGbYh07PcBM0wUQcM9k3egTCD51687hyLo4jkScv6ePlVCxEN4aII83t1HUMB7BDaF8_DLO3hsu-TPffPC99b4?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/af3S7-34bqokNEzA5WUdKd5iSlQ2k6mC6GbQk745Lso9DHsPwydRkBikoZ6ngqnnWOdH0cH9US-SN8F8FaYqOFX7AxmoANx0eUMMJdioLNw?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/33to9j8PfRjrygVw2nprxJt8MSsJAdNpQT_iuqPKrxpW h0I1rdHplOVIDljYNkIfufEhWuw0Q56n-G0aZcaSJ6VP03IIGe5w92oBoBbmmsQ?propósito=tamanho completo&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/pStyw6Zm2Jsb9O9d3hwulS-ZUiA1I_ygHG7WsGRTULvRuYSDLRYr6yBQ1ihpDX2PC2b3yu3qZi7UjrFR1SAE3_QTEJGOjGP4LWKFWq7SeYs?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/mdTnJjfWZUo-6yOX1ACvHlnbmKvDgCRZVM1RHbZVN0-Z LAj1ln1bt4GbrxOsvltEgt9LCljPb04nzKbwSEx-BS_-XuIezacMlVBm75ieN9s?purpose=tamanho completo&amp;v=1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/N214Wa3rPGfT8FQAvYQzv38xT0GzGobJxzr3RvA8nPiZC3cvDdWSGhLfp-wyUae9w9Gpa0qEBhC5pr4j6v8YsP2z5N_VDXf7eSEzp7L2Qbs?purpose=inline\"/></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Conhecida pelos seus têxteis tradicionais e pela sua igreja colonial construída sobre bases incas.</p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"tours-recomendados\">Passeios recomendados</h3>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Tour Clássico do Vale Sagrado:</strong> Pisac, Urubamba, Ollantaytambo e Chinchero.</li>\n<li><strong>Excursão VIP ao Vale Sagrado:</strong> Também inclui Moray e as Salineras de Maras.</li>\n<li><strong>Vale Sagrado + Tour Machu Picchu:</strong> Combine o passeio pelo vale com o trem para Machu Picchu.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"descubre-el-valle-sagrado-con-gt-peru-travel\">Descubra o Vale Sagrado com a GT Peru Travel</h3>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">com <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\"><strong>GT Peru Viagens</strong> </a>Você pode explorar o Vale Sagrado com transporte turístico, guias profissionais e organização segura de Cusco.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Entre em contato conosco e viva uma experiência inesquecível nos Andes Peruanos.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
